<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it upgraded Baker Hughes Inc to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Baker Hughes gained 3/4 to 39-3/8.</p>
</text>
